WEBVTT

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.570
Bõe yĩng t'a rã-yũudã yɩɩnd yʋngo? A Songhai kibarã.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:15.752
Pĩnd wẽndẽ wã, rũmsã fãa ra yɩɩnda ne sũ-noogo, la weoogã ra yaa kibsre.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:37.818
A ra tara koɛɛg sẽn tar pãng n yɩɩd a taabã fãa. Sẽn yɩɩd fãa, yaa noorã sẽn yaa kãsenga.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:41.530
Mam yaa sõma n yɩɩda! Dɩlla kelg-y!

00:00:44.000 --> 00:00:48.256
A ra tara sũ-sãanga, t'a kɩt tɩ neb a taabã yɩɩl pa noom ye.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:58.136
Neb a taabã sẽn da yẽgemd to-to wã, a yɩɩla ne pãng n paase.

00:01:07.000 --> 00:01:11.864
Wão wã sẽn yaa rũmsã rĩmã yãka yam n na n maan bũmb tɩ yɩ sõma.

00:01:13.000 --> 00:01:16.802
Yaa yɩɩl kibsre! B fãa bee taabẽ!

00:01:19.000 --> 00:01:23.666
Ned kam fãa ra zãmsda a meng: gɩgemdã, wũnda, la baa we-rũngã.

00:01:29.000 --> 00:01:35.090
La sã n yaa ne bugumã, a pa zãms ye. A ra miime t'a na n tõoga.

00:01:41.000 --> 00:01:46.824
La bõn-naandgã wʋma bũmb nins fãa a sẽn yetã, t'a ra zoe n yɛɛsame.

00:01:52.000 --> 00:01:55.904
La a yii n sigl-a lame, t'a gãneg a peendã.

00:02:10.000 --> 00:02:13.280
Zĩigã ra yɩɩndame, la bi-riblã me.

00:02:21.000 --> 00:02:27.458
B sẽn wa n na n maan bũmb ningã, b paama sũ-noogo. A tõoga, a tõoga n paase.

00:02:32.000 --> 00:02:36.362
A zẽka a meng n kẽe zĩm-gãongã pʋgẽ. La a paasa!

00:02:43.000 --> 00:02:44.760
Nebã fãa sega.

00:02:55.000 --> 00:02:59.442
A yãndã. Kẽerã kẽe koomẽ n solg b mens koomẽ wã.

00:03:08.000 --> 00:03:12.384
La neb a taabã kẽnga b zakẽ, tɩ wĩntoog zoe n sa.

00:03:29.000 --> 00:03:37.196
Zĩigã sẽn ta, a yikame ne sũ-bʋgsem. A gesa a sẽn gũbg-a wã: ned ka be ye.

00:03:42.000 --> 00:03:51.946
Rẽ n so t'a yɩɩl ne a sũur fãa. Maan-kãseng kolgame n na n kelg bãmba, la ãdsã sɩngame n yãgd ne vẽenem.

00:03:56.000 --> 00:03:58.672
Zĩigã ra yɩɩlda a poorẽ.

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:11.152
Sẽn sɩng ne bõn-naandgã yɩɩla yʋngo, tɩ ned ka le tõe n yãg-a ye.
